    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Proposed test with existing data: Within regions and major clades, regress the proportion of species with accepted varieties and varieties per varying species on genus species richness, controlling sampling effort. A consistent positive relationship supports the claim; zero or negative effects refute it.";
